cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper given under
  preferred-citation. The paper, with a detailed description of the algorithm
  and of the results, is coming soon.
title: "QuickSynth"
abstract: >-
  Near-optimal approximate synthesis of single-qubit unitaries over Clifford+T and
  Clifford+sqrt(T) at any magic-state price: QuickSynth, a lattice scan of whole
  denominator scales and a prefix split, in a C++ library with a Python interface.
